  "question": {
    "text": "Atom <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></math> occupies the fcc lattice sites as well as alternate tetrahedral voids of the same lattice. The packing efficiency (in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>%</mo></math>) of the resultant solid is closest to"
  },
  "options": [
